    "description": "Hello, and welcome. I am a Freelance Web Developer based in Milwaukee, Wisconsin and servicing customers nationwide. I am available to handle all of your web development projects from start to finish. I have a B.S. in Computer Science from UW-Milwaukee, and extensive programming and web development experience working with large and small business accounts. My experience includes 5 years as a Web Developer for a full-service web development company, and 15 years as a Business Partner and Technical Programmer with GroupE Communications, LLC. I have strong technical and analytical skills, combined with excellent creative and conceptual abilities. I am passionate, dedicated, and able to communicate effectively with all levels of an organization. I believe that follow-through, a results-oriented approach, and high quality work are keys to lasting customer relationships.",
